License scope

The original Forgeryscope source code in this repository, and the
Forgeryscope-authored portions of the non-YOLO checkpoints listed below, are
licensed under the MIT License below:

- wblot_duplicate_embedder.ckpt
- wblot_overlap_embedder.ckpt
- wblot_lane_embedder.ckpt
- micro_overlap_embedder.ckpt
- aliked_wblot.pth

Third-party components within these checkpoints retain their own terms. The
four embedding checkpoints use a pretrained Next-ViT backbone with upstream
Apache-2.0 terms. The ALIKED/LightGlue checkpoint includes components with
upstream BSD-3-Clause and Apache-2.0 terms. See README.md for references.

The YOLO detector checkpoints (yolo_panel_extractor.pt and
yolo_lane_extractor.pt) and Ultralytics YOLO code are outside this MIT grant.
Ultralytics licenses YOLO-trained models under AGPL-3.0 by default and offers
separate Enterprise licensing. Using YOLO to prepare training crops did not
incorporate YOLO code or weights into the non-YOLO checkpoints.

